  <running_head>GRAMMATICA</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>Secun-</catchword>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Conjuga Veneo.</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">Primum praesens : Veneo , <bl>ich werde verkaufft</bl>/ve-</l>
    <l n="3">nis,&amp;c. Imperfectum: Venibam. Perfectum : Venivi</l>
    <l n="4">&amp; venij.Futurum: Venibo,venibis,&amp;c.</l>
    <l n="5" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Conjuga,Memini,Odi,Coepi,Novi,</l>
    <l n="6" type="heading" level="2">Consuevi.</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">Primum praesens &amp; primum perfectum : Memini,</l>
    <l n="8">
      <bl>ich gedencke oder habe gedacht</bl>/ meministi , meminit.</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">Odi,<bl>ich hasse oder habe gehasset</bl>/odisti,</l>
    <l n="10">odit,&amp;c.</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">Coepi,<bl>ich hebe an/oder hab angefangē</bl>/coepisti,&amp;c.</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">Novi, <bl>ich weis/ kenne/ oder habe gewust/gekandt/</bl>
    </l>
    <l n="13">novisti,&amp;c.</l>
    <l n="14" para="true">Consuevi, <bl>ich pflege/oder habe pflegen</bl>/cōsuevisti.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">Secundum praesens &amp; secundum perfectū: Memine-</l>
    <l n="16">rim,Oderim,Coeperim,Noverim,Confueverim.</l>
    <l n="17" para="true">Primum imperfectū &amp; primum plusquā perfectū:</l>
    <l n="18">Meminerā, Oderam,Coperiā[?], Noveram,Confuevera.</l>
    <l n="19" para="true">Secundum imperfectum &amp; secundum plusquam</l>
    <l n="20">perfectum : Meminissem, Odissem, Coepissem, Novif-</l>
    <l n="21">sem,Confuevissem.</l>
    <l n="22" para="true">Secundum futurum : Meminero,Odero,Coepero,</l>
    <l n="23">Novero,Confuevero.</l>
    <l n="24" para="true">Tertium futurū: Memēto. Pluraliter : Mementot-</l>
    <l n="25">e.</l>
    <l n="26" para="true">Infinita: Meminisse,O-</l>
    <l n="27">disse,Coepisse,Novisse,Con-fuevisse.</l>
    <l n="28" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Conjuga possum.</l>
    <l n="29" para="true">Primum praesens : Possum , <bl>ich kan[?]</bl> / potes, potest,</l>
    <l n="30">possumus,</l>
    <l n="31">potestis,possunt.Secundū praesens:possim,</l>
    <l n="32">possis,possit,&amp;c poteram, possem, potui, potuerim,</l>
    <l n="33">potuerā,potuissem, potero,potuero,posse,potuisse.</l>
    <l n="34" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Conjuga Malo,Nolo.</l>
    <l n="35" para="true">Primum praesens : Malo , <bl>ich will lieber</bl>/ mavis,</l>
    <l n="36">
      <bl>du wilt lieber</bl>/mavult,malumus,mavultis,</l>
    <l n="37">malunt.</l>
    <l n="38" para="true">Nolo,<bl>ich will nit</bl>/non vis,<bl>du wilt nit</bl>/non vult,no-</l>
    <l n="39">lumus,non vultis,nolunt.</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Black letter German words are marked with bl. Doubtful readings: "kan" in the possum conjugation, "Coperiā" in the plusquamperfect line (possibly Coeperā), and "weis" (ß printed as long-s form). Printing errors left as printed.</notes>
